{"id":4052,"date":"2025-06-01T03:10:52","date_gmt":"2025-06-01T03:10:52","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4052"},"modified":"2025-08-11T04:26:38","modified_gmt":"2025-08-11T04:26:38","slug":"cach-chay-quang-cao-video-tren-tiktok","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/tin-tuc\/cach-chay-quang-cao-video-tren-tiktok\/","title":{"rendered":"C\u00e1ch ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o video tr\u00ean TikTok hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 t\u1eeb A-Z"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"RA70dvED5oVUj3x1BFQlJNujgxd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fcd4dB0FOovmPgxl2WrlSe7gg4f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o video tr\u00ean TikTok: T\u1ea1o video ng\u1eafn (15-60s), b\u1eaft trend, d\u00f9ng In-Feed Ads\/TopView, nh\u1eafm m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau \u0111\u00fang kh\u00e1ch, th\u00eam CTA r\u00f5. Theo d\u00f5i hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 qua TikTok Ads Manager. \u0110\u1ec3 bi\u1ebft chi ti\u1ebft c\u00e1c c\u00e1ch ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 t\u1eeb A &#8211; Z, c\u00f9ng <a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\"><strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong><\/a> t\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u nh\u00e9!<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEIFdhAsNoiDwhxlzr2lMY08gTe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"RA70dvED5oVUj3x1BFQlJNujgxd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-F362ds90ioTTqxx18J7lqEY5gvb\" style=\"text-align: left;\">T\u1ea1i sao qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o tr\u00ean TikTok quan tr\u1ecdng?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DIlRdpMVWoZbr9xBXxglmG2tgQe\">Qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o tr\u00ean TikTok ng\u00e0y c\u00e0ng quan tr\u1ecdng v\u00ec n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u00e0y \u0111ang s\u1edf h\u1eefu l\u01b0\u1ee3ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng kh\u1ed5ng l\u1ed3, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 gi\u1edbi tr\u1ebb \u2013 nh\u00f3m kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng v\u00e0 c\u00f3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng chi ti\u00eau cao. V\u1edbi c\u01a1 ch\u1ebf ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i n\u1ed9i dung d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd, video qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u00fang \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n t\u1ed1n qu\u00e1 nhi\u1ec1u chi ph\u00ed. Ngo\u00e0i ra, TikTok c\u00f3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng viral r\u1ea5t cao, gi\u00fap th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u lan t\u1ecfa nhanh ch\u00f3ng ch\u1ec9 trong th\u1eddi gian ng\u1eafn. Nh\u1edd v\u00e0o t\u00ednh n\u0103ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c cao, ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng d\u1ec5 b\u1ecb thu h\u00fat v\u00e0 h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng ngay sau khi xem qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o. Ch\u00ednh v\u00ec th\u1ebf, qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o tr\u00ean TikTok kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 t\u1ea1o \u0111\u1ed9 nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u m\u00e0 c\u00f2n th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y doanh s\u1ed1 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WhRodckCEomBSSxfv0ElHVQXgIS\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4057\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4057\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4057\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-24-1.png\" alt=\"Qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok gi\u00fap ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng nhanh ch\u00f3ng.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-24-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-24-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-24-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-24-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-24-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4057\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok gi\u00fap ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng nhanh ch\u00f3ng.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"RA70dvED5oVUj3x1BFQlJNujgxd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"RA70dvED5oVUj3x1BFQlJNujgxd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-CniudYMVQolASlxHOLblKvLag62\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Lo\u1ea1i qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o video tr\u00ean TikTok.<\/h2>\n<div>\n<table class=\"ace-table\" data-ace-table-col-widths=\"269;519\">\n<colgroup>\n<col width=\"269\" \/>\n<col width=\"519\" \/><\/colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MnlgdhLQVoUX1Jx5PpzlSrg8gHe\"><strong>Lo\u1ea1i qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o <\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DJaHdUwtcoAOUBxrHtyl7STbg7f\"><strong>Ch\u1ee9c n\u0103ng<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UwdWdgF37ouHqLxmUeAlIekDgqc\"><strong>In-Feed Ads<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRuAdmIMAottHkxtqsflCzZKgyg\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HfFFdKbX5oC7I8xu0K5l6uSHgSh\">Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb xen k\u1ebd trong trang \u201cFor You\u201d.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NltqdQmHVo0qWbx96XYlGeYpgPg\">Ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u01b0\u1edbt qua, th\u1ea3 tim, b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn ho\u1eb7c chia s\u1ebb.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DvqjdoSrWoOZ6mxp3IOldGVKgAe\">Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 k\u00e9o traffic v\u00e0 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LKmcdEC1boNWmAxra4elLoZdgng\"><strong>TopView Ads<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JmZsd9Bx6o0mrtxBFfElLRTsgsh\">Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean khi m\u1edf app TikTok, \u0111\u1ed9 d\u00e0i t\u1ed1i \u0111a 60 gi\u00e2y.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GvyEdEy94oCJskxl4SVla7YKgOd\">T\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LX83dwJKBomV54x258DlkH92gXw\"><strong>Brand Takeover Ads<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LRmcdELtAoezMXxExiYlvJWJgxc\">Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb ngay khi ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng m\u1edf \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng (\u1ea3nh, GIF ho\u1eb7c video 3\u20135 gi\u00e2y).<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JT4ld2sM7oRYwQxHNCsllpZLgIf\">Chi\u1ebfm to\u00e0n m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh, kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 n\u1ed9i dung n\u00e0o kh\u00e1c xen v\u00e0o.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ikt4dhZACooa1fxZ9VwlFfFpg7e\"><strong>Spark Ads<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GHvFdqUvMoQ8WhxP1VKlHOLpgWc\">Qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean video c\u00f3 s\u1eb5n t\u1eeb t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok th\u1eadt (c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1eeb KOL ho\u1eb7c ch\u00ednh doanh nghi\u1ec7p).<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TE84dCf6Hogd33xKlAnl43K7gB9\">Gi\u00fap t\u0103ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 tin c\u1eady.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G95YdPsZzoESIDxqGPulYIyzgrg\"><strong>Branded Hashtag Challenge<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MqIBdcofhow4cWxfgXxlfa8HgEh\">Doanh nghi\u1ec7p t\u1ea1o th\u1eed th\u00e1ch k\u00e8m hashtag ri\u00eang.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QQvndI2IToDRCKxvvLYluSpugSh\">Ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng tham gia b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch t\u1ea1o video theo ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 \u0111\u00f3 \u2192 t\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 lan t\u1ecfa.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EUmMdbIxooyqSUxKOf5lPOxXgXc\"><strong>Branded Effects<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JmdtdrxYQokVp0xmlyAlzGy0glf\">T\u1ea1o filter, hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng ri\u00eang cho th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I2Afdpue4oz80Nx8i9nlkj4Igje\">Khuy\u1ebfn kh\u00edch ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung v\u1edbi hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng \u0111\u00f3.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4056\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4056\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4056\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/26-3.png\" alt=\"TikTok Ads \u2013 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o th\u00f4ng minh, b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/26-3.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/26-3-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/26-3-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/26-3-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/26-3-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4056\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">TikTok Ads \u2013 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o th\u00f4ng minh, b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JF1OdvTZFoM3AOxkWLKlCF49gqE\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-NllNdS0lHozZpyxrITqlrXMPglh\" style=\"text-align: left;\">C\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o video tr\u00ean TikTok.<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JvqVdQykHogWfFxEMaZlJUKjgUc\">D\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 6 b\u01b0\u1edbc c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o video tr\u00ean TikTok:<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ZfmSdf5xFoP6qnxXz0MlxTWug3e\" data-type=\"divider\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: T\u1ea1o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok Ads<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EnnMd4hUCoh1vAxDXZKlc52jgdh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Truy c\u1eadp <a href=\"https:\/\/ads.tiktok.com\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/ads.tiktok.com<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QeGhd0yrNoj815xF7K4lzqdLgse\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n doanh nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1n \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 th\u00f4ng tin li\u00ean h\u1ec7.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-VXh1d1fGIoYrHixPWQdlFDiggYb\" data-type=\"divider\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: Thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fhg4dAQlLonjomxYVhulUuK7gGc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Nh\u1ea5n \u201cT\u1ea1o chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch m\u1edbi\u201d<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UfkedEMdkobJSpxy2AjldNZugfc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ch\u1ecdn m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p: <strong>L\u01b0\u1ee3t truy c\u1eadp<\/strong>, <strong>Chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i<\/strong>, ho\u1eb7c <strong>T\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tm8hdbCDaoE0ybxrijAlAfHWgWc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>\u0110\u1eb7t t\u00ean chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch v\u00e0 ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch t\u1ed5ng (c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ch\u1ecdn ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch kh\u00f4ng gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n)<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-L3CEdqqcIo2GBcxaGhFlivXygjd\" data-type=\"divider\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: C\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t nh\u00f3m qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o (Ad Group)<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Js2OdTOHLoY9TMxThDZlGvvUg2c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u1ecbnh d\u1ea1ng hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb: In-Feed Ads, Spark Ads, TopView, v.v.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RFLJdmr49oG2y6xO4RylTS9UgYc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>X\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau: \u0111\u1ed9 tu\u1ed5i, gi\u1edbi t\u00ednh, v\u1ecb tr\u00ed \u0111\u1ecba l\u00fd, s\u1edf th\u00edch, thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb,&#8230;<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VEeNdxp49o1o9XxvaMTlL3zagXc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>C\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t v\u1ecb tr\u00ed hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb, lo\u1ea1i thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb v\u00e0 h\u1ec7 \u0111i\u1ec1u h\u00e0nh n\u1ebfu c\u1ea7n<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-R2UzdfpvDos2WXxScawl7i3ng1b\" data-type=\"divider\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: \u0110\u1eb7t ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch &amp; l\u1ecbch ch\u1ea1y<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Et0YdxnV2owRVSxAwmelkb29gvc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ch\u1ecdn ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y ho\u1eb7c tr\u1ecdn \u0111\u1eddi<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9LEddL4yoGqItx2gKClDPsgggd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp th\u1eddi gian b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u v\u00e0 k\u1ebft th\u00fac<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KPMadFTfhoxScpxpht1l6ZUXgkI\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o theo khung gi\u1edd v\u00e0ng (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: 18h\u201322h)<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-D096d86czoNupAxO2N0l6HnugnO\" data-type=\"divider\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 5: Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf video qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VwDJdIM4noEKVTxJ7uTlqp9Bgnf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u1ea3i l\u00ean video c\u00f3 s\u1eb5n ho\u1eb7c t\u1ea1o m\u1edbi b\u1eb1ng c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 TikTok Video Creation<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kwqud02Ryozhpyxv7XmlmrtSg4e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ch\u00e8n v\u0103n b\u1ea3n, nh\u1ea1c n\u1ec1n, CTA (k\u00eau g\u1ecdi h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng) ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MX4EdeQWSoddfQxjIQIlxXhdgPe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>\u0110\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o video c\u00f3 n\u1ed9i dung h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn, chu\u1ea9n xu h\u01b0\u1edbng, \u0111\u1ed9 d\u00e0i t\u1ed1i \u01b0u 15\u201330 gi\u00e2y<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ST4kdetRaoHbNPxu4qLleITqgjh\" data-type=\"divider\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 6: \u0110\u0103ng qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o v\u00e0 theo d\u00f5i hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JU5md0qfQo5itExRxFelWsFAgWb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ki\u1ec3m tra l\u1ea1i to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Veu4dPGrboONqsxajrNl8SVrg8e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>G\u1eedi duy\u1ec7t qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o v\u00e0 ch\u1edd TikTok ph\u00ea duy\u1ec7t (th\u01b0\u1eddng trong 24 gi\u1edd)<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Po5OdCR4Oo4iJWxxXkGlZMsWg7f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Sau khi ch\u1ea1y, theo d\u00f5i hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t b\u1eb1ng <strong>TikTok Ads Manager<\/strong> ho\u1eb7c <strong>TikTok Pixel<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BfJ5dE9DPoEEVqx5Vb8l5LLLgeb\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4054\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4054\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4054\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/24-3.png\" alt=\"C\u00e1c d\u1ea1ng - lo\u1ea1i h\u00ecnh hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb tr\u00ean TikTok\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/24-3.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/24-3-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/24-3-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/24-3-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/24-3-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4054\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">C\u00e1c d\u1ea1ng &#8211; lo\u1ea1i h\u00ecnh hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb tr\u00ean TikTok<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-KNwQdkp7Oo55NTxXfTYlhPUYgye\" style=\"text-align: left;\">B\u00ed quy\u1ebft t\u1ea1o video qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok thu h\u00fat tri\u1ec7u l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem<\/h2>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Cga7dN17qom2Y3xrSbel1MnCglh\" style=\"text-align: left;\">B\u1eaft trend nhanh, theo kip xu h\u01b0\u1edbng<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R5cOdgyMGo4mlXx8X9rlhhtEg8e\">C\u00e1c video b\u1eaft trend tr\u00ean TikTok c\u00f3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng t\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem g\u1ea5p 3 l\u1ea7n so v\u1edbi video b\u00ecnh th\u01b0\u1eddng. Nghi\u00ean c\u1ee9u n\u0103m 2024 cho th\u1ea5y 70% video th\u1ecbnh h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ec1u s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng \u00e2m nh\u1ea1c v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng \u0111ang hot, gi\u00fap t\u0103ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u00e0 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-OU2LdfqQSoBHJ4xgsARl72VEg3f\" style=\"text-align: left;\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng hashtag th\u00f4ng minh<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OzEHdNJBooaBFaxndsAliBc7gAf\">Theo TikTok, video s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng hashtag \u0111\u00fang xu h\u01b0\u1edbng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u0103ng ph\u1ea1m vi ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn l\u00ean \u0111\u1ebfn 50%. K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p 3\u20135 hashtag li\u00ean quan v\u00e0 trending gi\u00fap video d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng l\u1ecdt v\u00e0o m\u1ee5c \u0111\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t v\u00e0 t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-FMVcdXs7Jo2IzTxxejClFcwogif\" style=\"text-align: left;\">G\u1ee3i CTA kh\u00e9o l\u00e9o, kh\u00f4ng \u00e9p bu\u1ed9c<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W4pQd4CGSo0OFaxIpDDlWXyggWc\">Video c\u00f3 CTA nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u00e0 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o c\u00f3 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c cao h\u01a1n 25% so v\u1edbi video ch\u1ec9 t\u1eadp trung qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u1ee9ng nh\u1eafc. V\u00ed d\u1ee5, s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00e2u \u201cB\u1ea1n ngh\u0129 sao? Comment nh\u00e9!\u201d gi\u00fap t\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn v\u00e0 gi\u1eef ch\u00e2n ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem l\u00e2u h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4055\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4055\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4055 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/25-3.png\" alt=\"T\u1ea1o video qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o tr\u00ean TikTok thu h\u00fat, ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn nhanh, ch\u1ed1t \u0111\u01a1n m\u1ea1nh.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/25-3.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/25-3-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/25-3-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/25-3-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/25-3-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4055\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">T\u1ea1o video qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o tr\u00ean TikTok thu h\u00fat, ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn nhanh, ch\u1ed1t \u0111\u01a1n m\u1ea1nh.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"RA70dvED5oVUj3x1BFQlJNujgxd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"RA70dvED5oVUj3x1BFQlJNujgxd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mud3dB0sKobgR3x78wkl2Nb0gXe\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-UGf9drlJQokXJ3xeUadlGAfpgAe\" style=\"text-align: left;\">C\u00e1c c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LNwgd0hMEoTKlpxrOYglYe8UgHd\">Ph\u00e2n t\u00edch chi ti\u1ebft \u01b0u nh\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec3m c\u00e1c c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 sau:<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-RuH5d6xCSo39Ntxj71NlwF8Ogfe\" style=\"text-align: left;\">TikTok Ads Manager<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H4Sld93rCoJqIixdqbmlDCmwg4g\">TikTok Ads Manager gi\u00fap qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng v\u1edbi giao di\u1ec7n d\u1ec5 d\u00f9ng. H\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 nhi\u1ec1u d\u1ea1ng qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o, nh\u1eafm m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch. V\u1edbi h\u01a1n 1 t\u1ef7 ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng h\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng (2025) v\u00e0 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o 5-8%, TikTok l\u00e0 k\u00eanh ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng. Tuy nhi\u00ean, x\u00e9t duy\u1ec7t qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ch\u1eadm v\u00e0 m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 t\u00ednh n\u0103ng ch\u1ec9 d\u00e0nh cho doanh nghi\u1ec7p \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-HdO2dUwXIoPpQdx4h2HlaXWagih\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Capcut<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YSIodaTT7ojGnExLirFlDwCPg9g\">CapCut l\u00e0 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 t\u1ea1o video mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed, d\u1ec5 d\u00f9ng tr\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i v\u00e0 m\u00e1y t\u00ednh, v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng, b\u1ed9 l\u1ecdc, \u00e2m nh\u1ea1c b\u1ea3n quy\u1ec1n v\u00e0 template theo trend TikTok gi\u00fap t\u1ea1o video nhanh ch\u00f3ng, h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda \u0111a l\u1edbp, hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng chuy\u1ec3n c\u1ea3nh m\u01b0\u1ee3t m\u00e0. \u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c TikTok ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n, CapCut \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 h\u01a1n 500 tri\u1ec7u l\u01b0\u1ee3t t\u1ea3i to\u00e0n c\u1ea7u (2024), v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng trung b\u00ecnh d\u00e0nh 20-30 ph\u00fat m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o video.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EFEjdJEHCoqbzgx6dKel3kUSgXe\">B\u00ean c\u1ea1nh \u0111\u00f3, CapCut c\u00f2n li\u00ean k\u1ebft qua app TikTok m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng, gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng xu\u1ea5t b\u1ea3n v\u00e0 chia s\u1ebb video nhanh ch\u00f3ng. Nh\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec3m l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 t\u00ednh n\u0103ng cao c\u1ea5p b\u1ecb gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n n\u1ebfu kh\u00f4ng tr\u1ea3 ph\u00ed, v\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda video ph\u1ee9c t\u1ea1p k\u00e9m linh ho\u1ea1t so v\u1edbi ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p nh\u01b0 Adobe Premiere.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-DrhNdtR6xoalw0x6RlqloZZqgPh\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Canva<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RyRedq84QoS7jLxztgUlxnXCgJf\">Canva h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p v\u1edbi giao di\u1ec7n k\u00e9o th\u1ea3 th\u00e2n thi\u1ec7n, th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n m\u1eabu \u0111a d\u1ea1ng, kho h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh, icon, font ch\u1eef phong ph\u00fa, nhi\u1ec1u m\u1eabu mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed v\u00e0 tr\u1ea3 ph\u00ed, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi xu\u1ea5t file ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng cao ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111a n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng. Theo th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea t\u1eeb Backlinko, t\u00ednh \u0111\u1ebfn th\u00e1ng 12 n\u0103m 2024, Canva c\u00f3 h\u01a1n 220 tri\u1ec7u ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng h\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng tr\u00ean to\u00e0n c\u1ea7u. V\u1edbi trung b\u00ecnh ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng Canva t\u1ea1o kho\u1ea3ng 38,5 tri\u1ec7u thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y ph\u1ea3n \u00e1nh m\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng cao c\u1ee7a n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u00e0y trong vi\u1ec7c t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf.y. Tuy nhi\u00ean, m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 t\u00ednh n\u0103ng n\u00e2ng cao v\u00e0 t\u00e0i nguy\u00ean \u0111\u1eb9p ch\u1ec9 c\u00f3 trong b\u1ea3n tr\u1ea3 ph\u00ed, v\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf video ch\u01b0a m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1c ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OMG1dkRTQobFYkxZWbYlBFDVgPo\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-U6LOdnkl2ouBecxTGr2l1Nzlg3f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;60d01c0d-a6ca-4aa1-8aa4-7dea6ebe0c23&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:192,&quot;width&quot;:192,&quot;currHeight&quot;:192,&quot;currWidth&quot;:192,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:600,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:600,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.32,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FLsX3bJMJtooztExFtfaleHnugib%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;LsX3bJMJtooztExFtfaleHnugib&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:51803,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RbbFdVdMaolUHBxOFvulUjuugob\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"IllhdmGJRo8Fc8xW7til2HR2gRd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZgVadBUjzo1nfUxOLYtleu14gSf\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QCqnd6hBNo4IYzxcxKqlGoKLgjf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UeVrdQPUoopt0kxHfWHlA4tHgSb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Email: <\/strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HJ13dgEyToxthRxlRj9lg7JigOc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Website: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CVKDdqIWdo2DJnx1XAFlkhXNgQd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O1BSduzbeoLTqkxPSt7lqseTgah\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o video tr\u00ean TikTok: T\u1ea1o video ng\u1eafn (15-60s), b\u1eaft trend, d\u00f9ng In-Feed Ads\/TopView, nh\u1eafm m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau \u0111\u00fang kh\u00e1ch, th\u00eam CTA r\u00f5. Theo d\u00f5i hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 qua TikTok Ads Manager. \u0110\u1ec3 bi\u1ebft chi ti\u1ebft c\u00e1c c\u00e1ch ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 t\u1eeb A &#8211; Z, c\u00f9ng Lemon Digital t\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u nh\u00e9! \u00a0 T\u1ea1i sao [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":4755,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[29,1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4052","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-kien-thuc-tiktok","category-tin-tuc"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4052","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4052"}],"version